OL,3,AApparent human remains found in US
OL,4,Areservoir as water levels hit record
OL,5,Alow
OL,6,
OL,7,FPotential human remains, including a
OL,8,Fjaw with teeth still attached, have
OL,9,Fbeen recovered from the largest
OL,10,Freservoir in the US, officials said, as
OL,11,Fan ongoing drought causes water levels
OL,12,Fto drop across western states.
OL,14,FThe US National Park Service said it
OL,15,Freceived reports of apparent skeletal
OL,16,Fremains at Boulder Beach on Lake Mead,
OL,17,FNevada, on 16 August.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
