OL,3,AApparent human remains found in US
OL,4,Areservoir as water levels hit record
OL,5,Alow
OL,6,
OL,7,F"National Park Service rangers and the
OL,8,FLas Vegas Metropolitan Police
OL,9,FDepartment responded to the scene," the
OL,10,Fservice said in a statement seen by the
OL,11,FBBC's US partner CBS.
OL,13,FThe service added that the incident
OL,14,F"remains under investigation, and no
OL,15,Fadditional information is available at
OL,16,Fthis time".
